{"id": "48234", "title": "梁实秋散文集", "author": "梁实秋", "category": "文学名著", "count": 36, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/48/48234/48234s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/48/48234.htm", "intro": "梁实秋（1903－1987），号均默，原名梁治华，字实秋，笔名子佳、秋郎，程淑等。中国著名的散文家、学者、文学批评家、翻译家，国内第一个研究莎士比亚的权威，祖籍中国浙江杭县（今余杭），出生于北京。代表作有《雅舍小品》、《雅舍谈吃》、《看云集》、《偏见集》、《秋室杂文》、长篇散文集《槐园梦忆》等。译有《莎士比亚全集》等。主编有《远东英汉大辞典》。", "base": "files/article/html/48/48234", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "1、影响我的几本书", "file": "6551701.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2、忆青岛", "file": "6551702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3、女人", "file": "6551703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4、双城记", "file": "6551704.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5、寂寞", "file": "6551705.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6、骂人的艺术", "file": "6551706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7、脸谱", "file": "6551707.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8、洗澡", "file": "6551708.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9、中年", "file": "6551709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10、住一楼一底房者的悲哀", "file": "6551710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11、南游杂感", "file": "6551711.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12、麻将", "file": "6551712.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "13、诗人", "file": "6551714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14、饮酒", "file": "6551715.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15、鸟", "file": "6551716.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16、雪", "file": "6551717.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17、旅行", "file": "6551718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18、下棋", "file": "6551719.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19、圆桌与筷子", "file": "6551720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20、雅舍", "file": "6551721.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21、衣裳", "file": "6551722.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22、谦让", "file": "6551723.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23、男人", "file": "6551724.html", "available": 